"open_questions": [
"Spin-tile maze: New Mauville's pair has no spin tiles. Mockup = plain crate maze. Recommend keeping it plain (crates already force a route); alternative: Mauville's blue/green electric barriers (0x2B7/2BF/2C7/2CF, 0x2B6/2BE/2C6/2CE) with floor buttons 0x236/0x22E in the hall-to-exit-room corridors, scripted like NewMauville_Inside.",
"Grunt gfx: Rocket sprites are invisible in this build; mockup uses Team Magma grunts. Recommend whichever team Orchid's Sevii story uses (or a new Orchid villain gfx later).",
"Tileset: General+BikeShop is used by no working-tree map (New Mauville and the Bike Shop were deleted), so adding it back is risk-free; recommend reusing it as-is.",
"Exit: Bike Shop green mat at the bottom of the exit room (2 warp cells) instead of New Mauville's wall door 0x276; recommend the mat (matches FRLG and the Meadow door)."
]
}
